    description: "DEEP bakeoff (cohort 1: Cap, spacedrive, yaak, readest) found that while Rust #[tauri::command] handlers are detected (135 in Cap), the TypeScript side (invoke/TAURI_INVOKE calls) produces nearly zero ipc_calls edges. Cap has 201 TS call sites but only 1 IPC edge. The tauri_ipc linker exists but is not matching the generated tauri-specta bindings pattern. Need to investigate why the linker fails for generated binding files."  # e540
